[center][size=6][color=#FFD600][b]Body Change NG v1.2.9[/b][/color][/size][/center]
[hr]
[size=4][color=#19D8FF][b]Preview restoration fixes[/b][/color][/size]
[list]
[*]Fix skin-preview cancellation after an NPC unloads. Undo restores the original native skin without forcing the actor to load; new unloaded selections still use the existing deferred-application behavior.
[*]Clean up detached overlay previews, including distribution checkbox previews, even without a committed BCNG actor record. Preserve newer selections and committed colors.
[*]Mark Default skin restoration complete only when both body and face cleanup succeed. Keep retry information after partial failure.
[/list]
[hr]
[size=4][color=#19D8FF][b]Scope and checks[/b][/color][/size]
Existing features, save formats, dependencies and supported SE/AE versions remain unchanged. No new permanent cache or continuous scan.
Release build and 32 offline regression executables passed, including 10,000 detach/cancel cycles. No new in-game tests were performed.
